# App version

Every pull request must bump `frontend/src/lib/version.ts` (`APP_VERSION`, `vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH`). Settings shows this string at the bottom of the page. Keep `frontend/src/lib/version.test.ts` format check passing (`vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH`). Name the version in the PR body.
